[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339270241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122580#issuecomment-5339270241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122580","id":5339270241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPj7MYQ","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T08:04:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T08:43:52Z","body":"It's probably due to float precision (floats aren't fully precise, can have slight errors, you can read https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/floatingpoint.html if you're hearing about this for the first time).\n\nIIRC Godot `print()` rounds floats like `0.30000000000000004` to `0.3,` so I ran the tests in Python:\n\n<img width=\"254\" height=\"122\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb78c5f9-b7c0-46fd-8461-ce2110bdfb03\" />\n\nYou can see that `int()` rounds the value to `44`, because it's actually `44.9999999...`, and not `45`.\n\nYou can verify this is also the case in Godot by running `print(1.45 - 1 == 0.45)`, which prints `false`, even though `1.45 - 1` is equal to `0.45`. If some problems with floats like this happen, use `is_equal_approx(float, float)` instead of `float == float`.\n\nIf you need the \"correct\" behavior, you can use this helper function I wrote:\n\n```\nfunc float2int(x: float) -> int:\n\tif is_equal_approx(x, ceilf(x)):\n\t\treturn ceili(x)\n\treturn floori(x)\n```\n\nThough it's not as fast as the `int()` call. (which probably doesn't matter)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339270241/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339672806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122580#issuecomment-5339672806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122580","id":5339672806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPkTw5g","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T08:42:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T08:42:24Z","body":"I don't believe there's an error here but a case of representation limitations","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339672806/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339821067","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122580#issuecomment-5339821067","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122580","id":5339821067,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPkc0Cw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T08:54:49Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T08:54:49Z","body":"This is indeed a normal floating point imprecision, `int()` is discarding fractional part (for performance), not rounding it, if you want rounding use `round()`.\n\n```\n      entered             stored\n      0.45                0x3FDCCCCCCCCCCCCD (0.45000000000000001)\n\nA     1.45                0x3FF7333333333333 (1.45000000000000000)\nB     1.00                0x3FF0000000000000 (1.00000000000000000)\nA-B                       0x3FDCCCCCCCCCCCCC (0.44999999999999996)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339821067/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340235211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122580#issuecomment-5340235211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122580","id":5340235211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPk2Fyw","user":{"login":"Ulliverus","id":191633586,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2wYsg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191633586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus","html_url":"https://github.com/Ulliverus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T09:32:49Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T09:32:49Z","body":"Okay, given that this is just a flaoting point error and therefore not a bug, I've closed the Issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5340235211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]